  - id: rs_start
    text: 'Hey fellow sailor, are you interested in a few races on these waters?
      My daughter is at many places at once - I always tell her to slow down, but
      she won''t listen. Anyway, if you are: She often sets anchor not far from here
      in the north east, far to the west, south west at pirate island and in the
      south east at long island. Good Luck!'
